// Valkyrie Profile 2 US (SLUS-21452  CC96CE93)
// Git: https://github.com/trulio2/PCSX2-Cheats/blob/master/SLUS-21452_CC96CE93.pnach


// Important Code: Stop the game from running through millions of bytes to create a checksum, and ignore it's validation
//
// The game creates an insane byte by byte hash to check for modifications after every cutscene, map change, battle and when saving
// And if the result of the checksum is wrong (the result will be wrong if even a single one of these bytes is modified) the game will send itself to an infinite loop (freeze). It's literally a while(true){ do nothing } lol
// It doesn't check the entire memory, but it seems like it checks every major function (Ether Laser and Angel Slayer addresses are not checked, probably doesn't check variable addresses, only static functions)
// I think this solution is better than the others i found online because they just skipped the final validation, but here i'm also stopping the checksum of millions of bytes to create the hash after cutscenes, map changing, saving and battles, so it also makes these transitions faster
//
// This code can be disabled if you're not using cheats that change bytes inside functions (it's fine if you're changing variable stuff, like items, stats and characters) (Since the code to stop freezes in battle and the code to stop the game from removing characters mess with functions, this code must be activated while using them)
// Must also be always on if you're trying to use 2 or more of the same character on the active team
//
// So, this is not needed if you don't have any of the (!) cheats currently enabled, are not trying to use dupes in battle and your save isn't corrupted 
//
// This code will ignore the validation and stop the convoluted checksum functions
[Disable Anti-Cheat Systems (! are cheats that requires this one, if they are kept enabled)]
author=Trulio
description=Ignore memory checksum validation and remove loop that creates it
// ---- Main Checksum (after cutscene, after battle, map change)
