// Important Code: Will prevent freezes if you have one of these characters on the active team in the beginning
//
// Actually, the game stores the ids of these 6 characters (Brahms, Freya, Valkryie, Silmeria, Lenneth and Hrist (in this order, hardcoded lol)), and will compare these ids
// to the id of each member in the active party before every battle, and if it finds a match, the game will go to a function to crash itself (this validation is skipped in the late game by default)
// There are multiple ways to solve this: Removing these stored ids (this is easy to do bc they're stored in a static address). Ignoring when the game tries to crash itself. Making the game think that it's in the late game
// But the best solution imo is to just skip the entire function that does this validation. This cheat will force the game to also skip this validation in the early game
//
// Can be disabled after getting to the Hall of Valhalla, no problems after that (the exact moment is right after beating the White Dragon when Alicia finds the ring that fell during the battle with Odin, their ult will also update here)
[(!) Anti Freeze In Battles]
author=Trulio
description=(Can be disabled after getting to the Hall of Valhalla)Prevent freezes when using late game characters in the beginning
patch=1,EE,D0398E10,extended,00001FFE
patch=1,EE,20398E10,extended,20030001


// Important Code: Stops the game from removing characters that are not supposed to be in the team at the current moment in the story
//
// Seems like the game keep flags for characters that are not supposed to be in the party at the current time, and will run a function to remove them after every cutscenes and some other events
// Characters will be removed if added before they're supposed to, and even if they're added again after leaving the party in the story.
// For some reason the game doesn't try to remove Freya, so you don't need this code if you're adding only her
// I guess it's because she's not a "normal" playable story character, since she only joins in Seraphic Gate
[(!) Stop The Game From Removing Characters]
author=Trulio
description=Stop the game from removing Brahms, Lenneth, Silmeria, Hrist, Valkyrie, Leone, Arngrim, Lezard and Dylan from the party (they won't be removed even if they're supposed to at that point in the story)
patch=1,EE,E002382B,extended,003BB5C4
patch=1,EE,203BB5C4,extended,087FAC00
patch=1,EE,203BB5C8,extended,0002382B
